<form class="filters noprint" method="get"><input type="hidden" name="organization_id" value="<?=ape($org)?>"><?php if($embedded):?><input type="hidden" name="embedded" value="1"><?php endif;?><label>Fund source / fiscal year<select name="fund_id" required><option value="">Select a fund</option><?php foreach($report['funds'] as $f):?><option value="<?=ape($f['id'])?>" <?=((int)$f['id']===$fund?'selected':'')?>><?=ape($f['source_code'].' · '.$f['name'].' · '.$f['fiscal_year'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>From date<input type="date" name="from" required max="<?=ape($today)?>" value="<?=ape($from)?>"></label><label>To date<input type="date" name="to" required max="<?=ape($today)?>" value="<?=ape($to)?>"></label><button>Generate report</button></form>
<?php if(!$report['fund']):?><p>Select a fund and an inclusive date range within one calendar year. For quarterly reporting, select the quarter or year-to-date.</p><?php else:$f=$report['fund'];$office=$report['office'];$months=['JAN','FEB','MAR','APR','MAY','JUN','JUL','AUG','SEP','OCT','NOV','DEC'];$quarters=array_fill(0,4,0);$classifiedQuarters=array_fill(0,4,0);$no=0;?>
<section class="heading"><div>Republic of the Philippines</div><div>Department of Education</div><strong><?=ape($office['name'])?></strong><h2>ACTUAL PROCUREMENT AND EXPENDITURE REPORT (APP)</h2><p>Reporting year <?=ape(substr($from,0,4))?> · Fund fiscal year <?=ape($f['fiscal_year'])?> · <?=ape($from)?> to <?=ape($to)?></p><p>OFFICE: <?=ape($office['name'])?><?=!empty($office['code'])?' · '.ape($office['code']):''?> | FUND: <?=ape($f['source_code'].' — '.$f['name'])?></p></section>
<p class="basis">Current-record review copy. Only finalized DVs with a valid RELEASED or CLEARED check and recorded release evidence are included. Grouped by saved DV document date, using current payment status (not an as-of historical snapshot). Amounts are gross paid DV costs before withholding. All supported budget expense and procurement asset debits are included. Local travel, seminars and training are consolidated by saved accounting title without itemization. Item quantities and prices are shown only where supported. For amount-only rows, monthly cells show pesos (₱), not quantities. Credit accounts and withholding transfers are not additional expenditures. Non-budget or unclassified debits require source review. Issued or signed but unreleased checks are excluded. The report is not the original approved APP or a certified historical snapshot.</p>
<div class="metrics"><div>Itemized procurement<strong><?=apm($report['total'])?></strong></div><div>Non-itemized / unresolved paid DV gross<strong><?=apm($report['unitemized'])?></strong></div><div>Withholding transfers excluded<strong><?=apm($report['nonproc'])?></strong></div><div>Total classified paid DV gross<strong><?=apm($report['eligible']-$report['nonproc']-$report['unclassified'])?></strong></div></div>
<?php if($report['review']):?><p class="notice"><?=count($report['review'])?> paid DV(s) require source or budget classification review. Saved accounting amounts appear under their accounting titles as amount-only lines. Review the DV schedule below for details; unclassified amounts are not assigned to an account by guesswork.</p><?php endif;?>
<?php if($report['legacyMatches']):?><p class="notice">Legacy classification: <?=count($report['legacyMatches'])?> DV(s) use a unique exact match of documented item amounts to approved debit totals. Marked item rows are derived for this report only; verify against source documents before submission. DV(s): <?=ape(implode(', ',array_column($report['legacyMatches'],'number')))?></p><?php endif;?>
<div class="table-scroll"><table class="app-grid" aria-label="Actual procurement by accounting title"><colgroup><col class="number"><col class="description"><col class="unit"><?php for($q=0;$q<4;$q++):?><col class="month"><col class="month"><col class="month"><col class="qty"><col class="money"><?php endfor;?><col class="qty"><col class="price"><col class="money"><col class="fund"></colgroup><thead><tr><th rowspan="3">No.</th><th rowspan="3">Item / expenditure</th><th rowspan="3">Unit of measure</th><th colspan="20">MONTHLY QUANTITY / ₱ AMOUNT</th><th rowspan="3">Total qty.</th><th rowspan="3">Unit price</th><th rowspan="3">Total amount</th><th rowspan="3">Fund source</th></tr><tr><?php for($q=1;$q<=4;$q++):?><th colspan="5">Quarter <?=$q?></th><?php endfor;?></tr><tr><?php for($q=0;$q<4;$q++):?><?php for($i=0;$i<3;$i++):?><th><?=$months[$q*3+$i]?></th><?php endfor;?><th>Qty.</th><th>Amount</th><?php endfor;?></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach($report['groups'] as $code=>$g):?><tr class="account"><th colspan="27" scope="rowgroup"><?=ape($g['title'].' ('.implode(', ',array_keys($g['codes'])).')')?></th></tr><?php foreach($g['rows'] as $l):?><tr><td><?=++$no?></td><td class="desc"><?=ape($l['description'])?><?php if($l['legacy_dv_ids']):?> <span class="derived" title="Legacy exact debit match — review source documents">*</span><?php endif;?><?php if(count($g['codes'])>1):?><small class="row-codes"><?=ape(implode(', ',array_keys($l['codes'])))?></small><?php endif;?></td><td><?=ape($l['unit'])?></td><?php for($q=0;$q<4;$q++):$qs=array_slice($l['qty'],$q*3,3);$as=array_slice($l['amounts'],$q*3,3);foreach($qs as $v):?><td><?=apq($v)?></td><?php endforeach;?><td class="subtotal"><?=apq(array_sum($qs))?></td><td class="money subtotal"><?=array_sum($as)?apm(array_sum($as)):'—'?></td><?php endfor;?><td><?=apq(array_sum($l['qty']))?></td><td class="money"><?=apm($l['price'])?></td><td class="money"><?=apm(array_sum($l['amounts']))?></td><td><?=ape($f['source_code'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?>
<?php foreach($g['amountOnlyRows'] as $l):?><tr class="amount-only"><td><?=++$no?></td><td class="desc"><?= $l['needsReview']?'Consolidated amount (review)':'Consolidated expense' ?><?php if($l['needsReview']):?> <span class="derived" title="Source or budget classification review required">*</span><?php endif;?><small class="row-codes"><?=ape(implode(', ',array_keys($l['codes'])))?> · Amount only</small></td><td>Amount</td><?php for($q=0;$q<4;$q++):$as=array_slice($l['amounts'],$q*3,3);foreach($as as $v):?><td class="money"><?=$v?'₱'.apm($v):'—'?></td><?php endforeach;?><td>—</td><td class="money"><?=array_sum($as)?apm(array_sum($as)):'—'?></td><?php endfor;?><td>—</td><td>—</td><td class="money"><?=apm(array_sum($l['amounts']))?></td><td><?=ape($f['source_code'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?>
<?php foreach($g['quarters'] as $q=>$v)$quarters[$q]+=$v;?><?php if($g['reviewAmount']&&$g['amount']):?><tr class="subtotal"><th colspan="3">Itemized subtotal</th><?php foreach($g['quarters'] as $q=>$v):?><td colspan="4"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($v)?></td><?php endforeach;?><td colspan="2"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($g['amount'])?></td><td></td></tr><?php endif;?>
<tr class="subtotal classified"><th colspan="3"><?= $g['reviewAmount']?'Accounting title total (paid DV gross)':'Accounting title subtotal' ?></th><?php foreach($g['classifiedQuarters'] as $q=>$v):$classifiedQuarters[$q]+=$v;?><td colspan="4"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($v)?></td><?php endforeach;?><td colspan="2"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($g['classifiedAmount'])?></td><td></td></tr><?php endforeach;?>
<?php if(!$report['groups']):?><tr><td colspan="27">No classified paid DV costs match these filters.</td></tr><?php endif;?><tr class="grand"><th colspan="3">TOTAL ITEMIZED PROCUREMENT</th><?php foreach($quarters as $v):?><td colspan="4"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($v)?></td><?php endforeach;?><td colspan="2"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($report['total'])?></td><td></td></tr><tr class="grand classified"><th colspan="3">TOTAL CLASSIFIED ACTUAL EXPENDITURES (PAID DV GROSS)</th><?php foreach($classifiedQuarters as $v):?><td colspan="4"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($v)?></td><?php endforeach;?><td colspan="2"></td><td class="money"><?=apm($report['eligible']-$report['nonproc']-$report['unclassified'])?></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<?php if($report['unclassified']):?><p class="notice">Unclassified paid DV gross: <?=apm($report['unclassified'])?>. Included in eligible DV gross, but not assigned to an accounting title above. Review saved debit evidence.</p><?php endif;?>
<?php foreach(['review'=>'Paid DVs requiring source or budget review','excluded'=>'Excluded from APP — review only'] as $key=>$label):if(!$report[$key])continue;?><section class="exception<?= $key==='excluded'?' noprint':'' ?>"><h3><?=ape($label)?></h3><p><?= $key==='review'?'Reference schedule only — do not add these amounts again. Classified amounts are already included in the accounting-title totals above, but not in the itemized procurement total. Travel, training and seminar expenses with valid saved budget debit evidence are intentionally consolidated without quantities or unit prices.':'Unpaid, invalid or non-procurement transactions; not counted in the APP total or included in the printed report.' ?></p><table class="exception-grid"><thead><tr><th>DV / date</th><th>Particulars / type</th><th>Gross amount</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($report[$key] as $r):?><tr><td><?=ape($r['number'].' / '.$r['date'])?></td><td><?=ape($r['particulars'].' · '.$r['type'])?></td><td class="money"><?=apm($r['gross'])?></td><td><?=ape($r['reason'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></section><?php endforeach;?>
<div class="signoff"><div>Prepared by:<span>____________________________</span></div><div>Reviewed by:<span>____________________________</span></div><div>Noted by:<span>____________________________</span></div></div><p class="basis">Compare with the separately approved APP and supporting documents before official submission. Printed signature lines are for manual review; no approval or budget certification is implied.</p>
